('scheme_csv_007', 'sukanya-samriddhi', 'sukanya-samriddhi', 'Sukanya Samriddhi Yojana (SSY)', 'Women Empowerment', 'parent', 'A small deposit scheme for the girl child, launched under the ''Beti Bachao Beti Padhao'' campaign.', 'Parents or legal guardians of a girl child aged 10 years or below. Maximum 2 accounts per family.', 'Girl Child''s Birth Certificate, Parent''s Identity and Address Proof, Photo', 'High interest rate, tax benefits under Section 80C, and a maturity payout when the girl turns 21.', 'Open account at any post office or authorized commercial bank branches by submitting the form and deposit.', 'https://www.indiapost.gov.in/', 'All India', 'en'),
('scheme_csv_008', 'pm-svanidhi', 'pm-svanidhi', 'PM SVANidhi Scheme', 'Business & Entrepreneurship', 'vendors', 'Special micro-credit facility scheme for providing affordable working capital loans to street vendors.', 'Urban street vendors vending in urban areas on or before March 24, 2020.', 'Aadhaar Card, Voter Card, Street Vendor ID Card or Letter of Recommendation (LoR)', 'Working capital loan up to Rs. 10,000 for 1st tranche, Rs. 20,000 for 2nd tranche, and Rs. 50,000 for 3rd tranche.', 'Apply online through PM SVANidhi Portal, or via a Banking Correspondent (BC)/Common Service Centre (CSC).', 'https://pmsvanidhi.mohua.gov.in/', 'All India', 'en'),
